<title>USA: CATTLE-FAX average feedlot cattle prices - Aug 1.</title>
<headline>CATTLE-FAX average feedlot cattle prices - Aug 1.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average prices for feedlot steers in the  main U.S. six-state and three-state regions, according to CATTLE-FAX  (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>6 STATES -</p>
<p> Thursday	  July 31  $66.27    up 0.18</p>
<p> Wednesday	 July 30  $66.09    up 0.92</p>
<p> Tuesday	   July 29  $65.17    up 0.89</p>
<p>3 STATES -</p>
<p> Thursday	  July 31  $66.02    up 0.12</p>
<p> Wednesday	 July 30  $65.90    up 1.10</p>
<p> Tuesday	   July 29  $64.80    up 0.80</p>
<p>Note: 6 states include TX, NE, KS, CO, OK, IA.</p>
<p>	    3 states include TX, KS, OK.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
